<title>ECUADOR: Ecuador's coffee export prices detailed.</title>
<headline>Ecuador's coffee export prices detailed.</headline>
<dateline>QUITO 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Here is a list of the minimum FOB reference prices for exporting 100-lb (45.36-kilo) sacks of Ecuadorean coffee, effective July 24-30:</p>
<p>	 Washed arabic....................$ 149.06</p>
<p>	 Natural arabic...................$ 133.24</p>
<p>	 Robust natural...................$  59.25</p>
<p>	 Roasted and/or ground............$ 114.53</p>
</text>
